Has anyone been able to get selinux support working under OpenSuSE 11.1
or SLES 11? =20

=20

They've included selinux in the kernel and have added selinux extensions
for the common utilities.  But so far I've been unable to get selinux
out of the disabled state.  And since they are not officially supporting
it, answers from Novell are hard to come by.

=20

Thanks!

=20

Alan


